WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:06.720
Last week, I mentioned to you that in the
36 hours or so after the tragic death of Supreme

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:12.799
Court Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg, one hundred
million dollars was donated to Joe Biden and

00:00:12.799 --> 00:00:17.140
other Democrats, a real sign of enthusiasm,
to put it very, very lightly.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:22.020
Well, we now have fundraising numbers from
Tuesday, and Joe Biden raised ten million

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:27.790
dollars during the three hour period surrounding
the first presidential debate with Donald

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:30.020
Trump in the first hour alone.

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:34.210
Joe Biden raised three point eight million
dollars.

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:37.640
This is a campaign fund raising record for
a single hour.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:42.700
And then if you look at the nine p.m. to midnight
Eastern Bloc, ten million dollars raised.

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:48.060
Two hundred and fifteen thousand donations,
including 60000 new donors who had not previously

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:55.000
donated and one hundred thousand people signed
up to volunteer for the campaign.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.460
Now, this is not a guarantee of anything.

00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:01.970
We don't yet have Trump's fundraising numbers
to compare for during the debate.

00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:03.950
But this is very good for Joe Biden.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:08.450
And I feel like I don't even need to say this
now, but I will.

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:10.880
I hate how our elections are financed.

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:14.409
I despise the money system that we have.

00:01:14.409 --> 00:01:18.340
But for the next 35 days, it's the system
that we have and the one that Joe Biden has

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:19.850
to use to win.

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:24.780
And seeing ten million dollars raised in three
hours is just stunning.

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:29.159
What seems them to be motivating lots of donations
is people realized when they were watching

00:01:29.159 --> 00:01:31.179
the debate.

00:01:31.179 --> 00:01:33.679
Trump doesn't want more people to vote.

00:01:33.679 --> 00:01:35.869
Trump wants fewer people to vote.

00:01:35.869 --> 00:01:42.599
There was no way to watch the debate and not
pay attention to the reality that Donald Trump

00:01:42.599 --> 00:01:46.450
would prefer that you not vote, particularly
if you don't like him.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:50.829
But on balance, Donald Trump has figured out
that all else being equal, he's better off

00:01:50.829 --> 00:01:52.409
if he suppresses the vote.

00:01:52.409 --> 00:01:55.420
And it was very transparent during that debate.

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:56.539
People didn't like it.

00:01:56.539 --> 00:01:58.249
People saw it.

00:01:58.249 --> 00:02:06.340
And they saw the completely undemocratic authority,
authoritarian nature of Donald Trump, who

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:13.810
also doesn't want to accept the election results
unless he wins and is preemptively saying

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:19.010
if the results are anything other than he
won, he will say that the results are rigged.

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:21.790
And this has motivated people to donate.

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:23.360
We will see where it gets us.

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:24.560
In just about a month.

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:28.200
But what what I like hearing about this is.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:34.379
To put it lightly, there are a lot of ignorant
and uninformed people in this country who

00:02:34.379 --> 00:02:35.720
fall for anything.

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:40.060
And 60 million of them fell for voting for
Trump in 2016.

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:42.810
Sixty million are likely going to fall for
it again.

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:48.160
What was for me inspiring to see was that
even though Donald Trump didn't come out and

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:52.410
say, I don't want people to vote, I want people
to stay home.

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:55.599
You know, he used sort of coded language.

00:02:55.599 --> 00:02:56.870
People saw through it.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:57.870
People watched it.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:02.190
And they said, I can determine from what he
is saying, what he really means, and I don't

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:03.439
like it.

00:03:03.439 --> 00:03:05.250
And I'm going to donate to Joe Biden.

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.500
So incredible numbers for Biden.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:04:02.090
I'll have the Trump numbers for you when

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:32.190
they

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:56.690
are out.

